We start with an empty order. my @lines = ();

A helper adds a line through a reference.

sub add_line {
    my ($order, $name, $count) = @_;
    push @$order, [ $name, $count ];
    return $order;
}

then we add coffee twice. add_line(\@lines, "coffee", 2);
and a mug once through the same order. add_line(\!-1, "mug", 1);

Then we print each line.

foreach my $line (@lines) {
    print $line->[0], " x ", $line->[1], "\n";
}
